      "target": "Strings/StringsFromMaps",
      "key": "HaleyHouse.17",
      "field": null,
      "source": "To our beloved girls:^We miss you and hope that you are doing okay on your own. We just left the Fern Islands last night, after staying for two months.^It was a wonderful experience... highly recommended.^Make sure you eat healthy and don't forget to pay the electricity bill!^^Love, Mom & Dad",
